# Color, star, due-tomorrow and complete from the command menu all apply to the edited task, and typing goes on.
file <<END
- Water plants
END
see Water plants
keys <Enter> /
type color b
see Color: Blue
keys <Enter> /
type star
keys <Enter> /
type due tom
keys <Enter> /
type comp
keys <Enter>
type !
keys <Esc>
see ✔ Water plants!
quit
saved <<END
- Water plants! @blue @star @due({today+1}) @done({today})
END
